efits & Information Time Off Leave of Absence Workplace Injuries & Accommodations Benefit Vendors & Providers Contact Information Employee Resources Employee Relations Employee & Staff Handbooks Manager Resources Separation from Employment & Offboarding New Hire Welcome Center Learning & Development LinkedIn Learning Performance Management New Hire Required HR Training Breadcrumb Home Offices & Services The Office of Human Resources Welcome to the Human Resources Career Page Saint Mary’s College is currently transitioning its Human Resources recruitment platform from Paylocity to NeoEd. During this transition period, some open positions will remain posted in Paylocity while all new job postings moving forward will be posted in NeoEd. To ensure applicants can easily locate all available opportunities, please use the links below to view positions in each system. For Faculty and Adjunct Positions, please click here . Staff Positions Paylocity To view open positions posted in Paylocity prior to March 6, 2026, please click here . These postings will remain available in Paylocity until the positions are filled or through March 31, 2026, whichever occurs first. NeoEd For positions posted in NeoEd beginning March 9, 2026, please click here . Footer - Academics Academics Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs Footer - Admissions Admissions Apply Request Information Contact Admissions Resources Resources Library Bookstore Museum of Art Careers at SMC For the Media Footer - Financial Aid Financial Aid Tuition and Fees Scholarships University Credit Union Campus Info Our Campus Campus Map Parking & Transportation Accessibility at SMC Land Acknowledgment Emergency Information Immigration Enforcement Image 1928 St. Marys Rd Moraga, CA 94575 (925) 631-4000 © 2026 Saint Mary’s College of California Legal Nondiscrimination Policy Privacy Policy Title IX Login"
